        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "796ba3f6-8dbe-3fb2-a16e-465cdbfcbb80",
                "word": "collapsologie",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "4128d8b5-0d93-4bbf-b85f-28cc06f1d8c9",
                        "entry_id": "796ba3f6-8dbe-3fb2-a16e-465cdbfcbb80",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "collapsologies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bea47c8a-b3ac-3dde-81f6-d99c64752c08",
                        "entry_id": "796ba3f6-8dbe-3fb2-a16e-465cdbfcbb80",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Approche interdisciplinaire et prospective qui rassemble des savoirs issus des sciences naturelles et sociales afin d’analyser les risques d’effondrement des sociétés industrielles contemporaines et d’en explorer les conséquences possibles."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Écologie politique",
                            "Sciences sociales"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "41f4a9ba-2c3f-487d-b17a-5d090a86317e",
                                "sense_id": "bea47c8a-b3ac-3dde-81f6-d99c64752c08",
                                "text": "Car un nombre croissant d’auteurs, de scientifiques et d’institutions annoncent la fin de la civilisation industrielle, telle qu’elle s’est constituée depuis plus de deux siècles. Pablo Servigne et Raphaël Stevens, en décortiquant les ressorts d’un possible effondrement et cela grâce à un tour d’horizon interdisciplinaire sur ce sujet, se proposent de nommer « collapsologie » cette analyse."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1bc8453b-1566-4f44-8290-b65f93092fc0",
                                "sense_id": "bea47c8a-b3ac-3dde-81f6-d99c64752c08",
                                "text": "L’occasion de revenir avec le fondateur de la collapsologie sur la crise climatique."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "82bc7900-49ae-4c5b-99fc-1b74bcf349d4",
                                "sense_id": "bea47c8a-b3ac-3dde-81f6-d99c64752c08",
                                "text": "« Collapsologie » faisait partie des dix vocables soumis au vote de ses lecteurs par le quotidien belge Le Soir pour déterminer « le mot de l'année 2018 »."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4c8c28df-0e62-4475-8c2d-0ee123110a82",
                        "source_entry_id": "796ba3f6-8dbe-3fb2-a16e-465cdbfcbb80",
                        "source_sense_id": "bea47c8a-b3ac-3dde-81f6-d99c64752c08",
                        "target_lang_word": "collapsology",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "collapsology",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "526116a7-998f-36a4-8082-c5cc31d57673",
                                        "entry_id": "41fecc01-ce39-3260-b899-da90172fe638",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The transdisciplinary study of the collapse of industrial civilization, and what might succeed it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncommon",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb75a8c9-408f-47c3-8e8c-4a9f4aa59b55",
                                                "sense_id": "526116a7-998f-36a4-8082-c5cc31d57673",
                                                "text": "This will be the true purpose of collapsology, which we define as the transdisciplinary study of the collapse of our industrial civilization, and what might succeed it, based on the two cognitive modes of reason and intuition and on recognized scientific studies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "896af174-2d38-4fd4-b9cd-d24214564a40",
                                                "sense_id": "526116a7-998f-36a4-8082-c5cc31d57673",
                                                "text": "For the authors of the Jean Jaurès study, the political scientist Jérôme Fourquet and the pollster Jean-Philippe Dubrulle, collapsology is driven at least in part by economic factors."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b947598a-f3ab-481f-a6c0-5655303eff89",
                                                "sense_id": "526116a7-998f-36a4-8082-c5cc31d57673",
                                                "text": "Collapsology has been likened to the cultural equivalent of an advance directive in the medical world, whereby you specify what actions should be taken for your health if you are no longer able to make decisions[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
